# Science and Society — Complete Workflow

## Overview

**Science and Society** (internally named *Gyan Samavesh 2026*) is an academic journal submission and peer-review platform built with **React + Vite** and backed by **Supabase** (auth, database, storage). It supports three user roles — **Student**, **Reviewer**, and **Admin** — each with their own dashboard and responsibilities.

---

## Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|-------|-----------|
| Frontend | React 18 + Vite 5 |
| Routing | React Router DOM v6 |
| Backend/Auth | Supabase (Auth, PostgreSQL, Storage) |
| Icons | Lucide React |
| Styling | Vanilla CSS (`globals.css`) |

